# inventory/group_vars/.gitignore
# Per-image local override files - see scripts/build.sh's own "Local,
# untracked overrides" comment (right after GROUP_VARS_FILE is validated)
# for the full mechanism. This repo is public, so real site-specific
# values that shouldn't be public - guest_ip_cidr/guest_gateway/
# guest_dns_servers today, see <image_key>.yml's own comment on those
# three - belong in <image_key>.local.yml on each control node instead of
# the committed <image_key>.yml. Never commit one of these, whatever its
# name - that's the whole point of this file existing.
*.local.yml
